massage store). She has a forceful and dynamic personality but when it comes to treatment, her skills as a masseur are first-class. Due to her excellent communication skills, she has the highest appointment rate in the world. She takes the liberty of putting herself in charge of Takashi and sexually harasses him while giving him treatments, but in fact she is planning to ensnare him and make him hers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98077"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リラクゼーションサロンのセラピスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強引で豪快な性格だが、施術は超一流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を、セクハラまがいの施術で自分のものにしようと画策中。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23726","sourceWorkId":"31160","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。22歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リラクゼーションサロン（タイ古式マッサージ店）『アーユス・ラクシュミー』のセラピスト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強引で豪快な性格をしているが、施術に関しては、一流の腕を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのコミュ力の高さから、指名率がダントツに高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝手に高司の担当になり、施術と共にセクハラを行ってくるが、実は篭絡して自分のものにしようと画策している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97665"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c769aba1c2e484d5335f9de3d2aff753222b15d0c5c4fe670f8d1ed3bdafd9d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4c91bd0c72c03fa517cfd59cf5a137fe0c8c912a41b75da4b3db9de9f7d4730.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朝比奈幸","creatorId":"vndb:s21648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21648","name":"朝比奈 幸","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:338145:97665:17080:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"綾音 まこ","creatorId":"vndb:s2581","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2581","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2581","name":"綾音 まこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:87942","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c98078","characterName":"雨宮 伊鞠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"97664","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"338145"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23725"],"vndbCharacterId":"c98078"},"originalCharacterName":"雨宮 伊鞠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Director of the Amamiya Dental Clinic. She has been taking care of the protagonist's dental maintenance regularly for about a year now. At first glance, she appears to be a calm, soothing woman, but she loves cute boys and never leaves the protagonist in charge of anyone else. She has a secret ambition to monopolize everything about him one day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98078"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雨宮歯科医院長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年ほど前から主人公の定期健診をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見おっとりした癒し系だが、主人公が大好きで、担当を決して他人に任せない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23725","sourceWorkId":"31160","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。27歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雨宮歯科医院長。一年ほど前から高司の歯のメンテナンスを定期的に行っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見おっとりした癒し系の女性だが、カワイイ男の子が大好きで、高司の担当を決して他に任せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつか、全てを独占したいという密かな野望をもっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97664"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4ab293a6114a298297e840338a79df99000df93354b3bca3e1b8d9937ea75895.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4101db925ca069b4956738b97c6a035520c44fc351f42f